<title>MALTA: PRESS DIGEST - Malta - Jan 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Malta - Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Maltese press on Monday. Reuters has not venified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THE TIMES</p>
<p>- Chilling accounts of shipwreck ordeal in Malta-Sicily channel.</p>
<p>IN-NAZZJON</p>
<p>- Opposition Leader Eddie Fenech Adami complains that Prime Minister Alfred Sant has not replied to a letter he wrote to him three weeks ago requesting a television frequency for the Nationalist Party to make test transmissions.</p>
</text>
